.booping.log gains one [..]-wildcarded line when a vault is attached.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: test-project
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
core:
  test_macro:
    command: ["echo", "test"]
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plan.md ---
---
title: Test Plan
status: backlog
---

# Test Plan Content

This is a test plan.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update vault/plan.md status=in-progress
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- expected/cwd/vault/.booping.log --
[..]Z: [frontmatter-update] vault/plan.md -status
-- stderr --
error: plan not found: vault/plan.md
